---
description: Hardening rules for GitHub Actions workflow files
globs: .github/workflows/**
alwaysApply: false
---
- Top-level `permissions:` with minimum scopes; widen per job only.
- Pin third-party actions to a full commit SHA with a `# vX.Y.Z` comment.
- Never put `${{ github.event.* }}` text inside `run:`; use `env:` and quote it.
- No `pull_request_target` with a checkout of PR code; `concurrency` + `timeout-minutes` on PR jobs.
- Validate with `make ai-validate` (actionlint + zizmor) before committing.
